---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+15805550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(580) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="AC Installation in Ardmore, OK | New System Install" description="Professional AC installation in Ardmore, OK. Properly sized systems, code-compliant installs, workmanship warranty.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>AC Installation</h1>
      <p>Code-compliant central and ductless installs for Ardmore homes.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>Whether you're replacing an aging system or installing cooling for the first time, we size and install air conditioners correctly for Oklahoma's climate and your home's needs.</p>
      <h2>Installation Benefits</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Load calculation and proper sizing</li>
        <li>Same-day installs often available</li>
        <li>Central, heat pump, and ductless options</li>
        <li>Permit guidance and code compliance</li>
        <li>Workmanship warranty on every install</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Ready to Schedule?</h2>
      <p>Call <a href={`tel:${phone}`}>{phoneDisplay}</a> for AC installation in Ardmore, OK.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
